<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠνο-κέφᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dog-headed</i>: οἱ K., <i>Dog-heads</i>, name of a people,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.191
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ctes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				57.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				431
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dog-faced baboon, Simia hamadryas</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				161c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				166c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				502a19
			</span></i>, etc.; sacred animal in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JTr.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνοκέφαλον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύλλιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.69
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίρρινον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.744
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνοκεφάλλῳ</span> at the close
			of an iambic tetrameter, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				416
			</span></i>, where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λλ</span> is attested by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.85
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>]</div>
